cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use xean in published work, cite the repository with the metadata below.
type: software
title: "xean: mathematical exploration with durable evidence"
abstract: >-
  A Bun and TypeScript toolkit for LLM-driven mathematical exploration. A
  campaign is a SQLite journal recording the task, model calls, tool activity,
  candidate material, verdicts, request checkpoints, and provider accounting.
  xean-solve runs an explorer, coordinator, and independent verifier workflow
  over that journal.
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Chao
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/chaoxu/xean
url: https://github.com/chaoxu/xean
keywords:
  - mathematics
  - automated reasoning
  - large language models
  - proof verification
